  "description": "Connects the OASIS to Neo4j -- the world's leading native graph database. Stores OASIS holons, avatars, and karma relationships as graph nodes and edges, enabling powerful graph traversal, social network analysis, and karma chain queries via Cypher. Part of the OASIS HOT-Swappable Provider Architecture. Ecosystem: https://oasisomniverse.one",
